# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
venv/
.venv/

# PCIS runtime data -- the app writes this wherever it is launched from.
# It contains your own logged recommendations; it is data, not source.
pcis.db
*.db

# Generated outputs
*.csv
pcis_training_data.csv
sample_report.pdf

# The web payload is BUILT from pcis/core + pcis/equipment by
# tools/build_web_payload.py. It is committed deliberately (Vercel
# serves it as a static asset and does not run Python at build time),
# so it is NOT ignored -- but remember to regenerate it after changing
# the engineering core, or the phone will run stale physics.

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets.
#
# frontend/.gitignore already covers .env*.local, but a self-hoster running
# the FastAPI service locally will write backend/.env or a root .env with a
# real Supabase service-role key in it -- a key that bypasses every RLS
# policy in the database. Nothing was covering those paths.
#
# Negated last so the committed *.example templates still ship.
.env
.env.*
*/.env
*/.env.*
!.env.example
!*/.env.example
!*.env.local.example
